{"seq":1,"slug":"saga-pattern","title":"Saga 模式与补偿事务","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/distributed-transactions-saga/saga/saga-pattern","wordCount":1511,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"saga-模式与补偿事务\">Saga 模式与补偿事务</h1><p>Saga 这个词来自 1987 年 Hector Garcia-Molina 与 Kenneth Salem 的同名论文，原本是为解决数据库里「长活事务（long-lived transaction）长期持锁」而提出的。三十多年后它在微服务时代二次走红，成了跨服务长事务的事实标准答案。它的妙处在于一句话就能说清，但真正用对却处处是坑。本节立起 Saga 的骨架与最关键的取舍——为什么它能替代 <a href=\"../foundations/atomic-commit-2pc\">2PC</a>，又为什么它不是免费午餐。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-一串本地事务加补偿\">核心概念：一串本地事务加补偿</h2><p>Saga 把一个原本想原子完成的分布式事务，拆成一个有序的本地事务序列 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_1, T_2, \\ldots, T_n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。每个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 只操作单个服务的单个数据库，因此各自满足完整的 <a href=\"../foundations/acid-cap-consistency\">ACID</a>、能立即本地提交。关键在于：为每个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 都准备一个对应的补偿事务 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，它在语义上「撤销」<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的效果。当 Saga 执行到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 失败时，系统反向依次执行 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{k-1}, C_{k-2}, \\ldots, C_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8917em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，把已经提交的步骤逐个逻辑回滚。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  S[Saga 开始] --&gt; T1[T1 创建订单]&#10;  T1 --&gt; T2[T2 扣减库存]&#10;  T2 --&gt; T3[T3 扣减余额]&#10;  T3 --&gt;|成功| OK[Saga 完成]&#10;  T3 --&gt;|失败| C2[C2 回补库存]&#10;  C2 --&gt; C1[C1 取消订单]&#10;  C1 --&gt; FAIL[Saga 已补偿/中止]\">flowchart TD\n  S[Saga 开始] --&gt; T1[T1 创建订单]\n  T1 --&gt; T2[T2 扣减库存]\n  T2 --&gt; T3[T3 扣减余额]\n  T3 --&gt;|成功| OK[Saga 完成]\n  T3 --&gt;|失败| C2[C2 回补库存]\n  C2 --&gt; C1[C1 取消订单]\n  C1 --&gt; FAIL[Saga 已补偿/中止]</pre><p>注意补偿不是数据库回滚——<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 早已提交，库存数字真的减过了；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是一笔全新的、把库存加回去的本地事务。这个区别决定了 Saga 的一切特性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"补偿事务-逻辑撤销-而非物理回滚\">补偿事务：逻辑撤销，而非物理回滚</h2><p>补偿事务是 Saga 与传统事务最本质的分野。传统回滚是存储层的物理操作，能让数据精确回到事务开始前的字节级状态；补偿则是业务层的逻辑操作，只能让数据回到「语义上等价于没做过」的状态，而过程中产生的副作用未必能抹平。</p>\n<p>举个尖锐的例子：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 发了一封「订单确认」邮件，它的补偿 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 能做的最多是再发一封「订单取消」邮件，却没法让那封已发出的邮件从用户收件箱里消失。这说明补偿设计必须接受「不可逆副作用」的存在，并把不可逆的步骤尽量放到 Saga 末尾（成为关键步骤 pivot，详见 <a href=\"compensation-semantics\">补偿语义与幂等性</a>）。下表对照两种「撤销」：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>数据库回滚（2PC/本地事务）</th>\n<th>补偿事务（Saga）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>层次</td>\n<td>存储层，物理</td>\n<td>业务层，逻辑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时机</td>\n<td>提交前</td>\n<td>已提交之后</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>能否抹除副作用</td>\n<td>能（未提交即不可见）</td>\n<td>不能（已对外可见的副作用残留）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中间态可见性</td>\n<td>不可见（隔离性保护）</td>\n<td>可见（其他事务能看到中间结果）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实现成本</td>\n<td>数据库内置</td>\n<td>业务自行编写并保证幂等</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"牺牲隔离性-saga-只保-acd\">牺牲隔离性：Saga 只保 ACD</h2><p>回到 <a href=\"../foundations/acid-cap-consistency\">ACID</a> 的四项承诺，Saga 作为一个整体只保证 ACD，独独牺牲了 I——隔离性。原因直白：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 提交后到整条 Saga 结束前，存在一段窗口，期间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 写下的数据对其他事务完全可见。如果此时另一个事务读到了这些「尚未确认全局成功」的数据并据此行动，就埋下了隐患。</p>\n<p>缺少隔离性带来三类典型异常。脏读（dirty read）：另一事务读到了一个最终会被补偿掉的中间值。丢失更新（lost update）：两个并发 Saga 都基于同一旧值修改，后者覆盖前者。模糊读（fuzzy read）：同一事务先后两次读同一数据，因为别的 Saga 中途提交而读到不同结果。这些异常在单库里被隔离性自动挡掉，在 Saga 里必须由设计者主动应对。</p>\n<h2 id=\"弥补隔离性缺失的对策\">弥补隔离性缺失的对策</h2><p>工业界总结了一组「语义锁」对策来缓解隔离性缺失，核心思想是用业务字段显式标记数据的「在途」状态，让其他事务知道这块数据正被某个 Saga 操作、暂不可信。常见手法包括：用状态字段（如订单的 <code>PENDING</code> / <code>CONFIRMED</code>）让读者能识别中间态并选择忽略或等待；用版本号做乐观并发控制，提交补偿时校验版本以发现冲突；以及交换式更新（commutative updates），让操作顺序无关，从根本上消除丢失更新。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[数据被 Saga 修改] --&gt; B[打上语义锁&lt;br/&gt;状态=PENDING]&#10;  B --&gt; C{其他事务访问?}&#10;  C --&gt;|读| D[识别 PENDING&lt;br/&gt;忽略或等待确认]&#10;  C --&gt;|写| E[校验版本号&lt;br/&gt;冲突则拒绝/重试]&#10;  B --&gt; F{Saga 最终结果?}&#10;  F --&gt;|成功| G[状态置 CONFIRMED&lt;br/&gt;释放语义锁]&#10;  F --&gt;|失败补偿| H[补偿事务还原&lt;br/&gt;释放语义锁]\">flowchart TD\n  A[数据被 Saga 修改] --&gt; B[打上语义锁&lt;br/&gt;状态=PENDING]\n  B --&gt; C{其他事务访问?}\n  C --&gt;|读| D[识别 PENDING&lt;br/&gt;忽略或等待确认]\n  C --&gt;|写| E[校验版本号&lt;br/&gt;冲突则拒绝/重试]\n  B --&gt; F{Saga 最终结果?}\n  F --&gt;|成功| G[状态置 CONFIRMED&lt;br/&gt;释放语义锁]\n  F --&gt;|失败补偿| H[补偿事务还原&lt;br/&gt;释放语义锁]</pre><p>这些对策不是免费的——它们把数据库本该提供的隔离性，变成了需要业务代码反复正确实现的横切关注点。这正是 Saga「把复杂度转嫁给业务」的具体体现，也是它和 <a href=\"../foundations/atomic-commit-2pc\">2PC</a> 之间最实在的取舍：2PC 用阻塞换隔离，Saga 用业务复杂度换无阻塞。</p>\n<h2 id=\"saga-与-2pc-的本质交换\">Saga 与 2PC 的本质交换</h2><p>把 Saga 放回 <a href=\"../foundations/why-distributed-transactions\">为何分布式事务困难</a> 描绘的三角里就一目了然。2PC 站在「强一致 + 低复杂度（数据库内置）」一角，代价是阻塞与低可用；Saga 站在「高可用 + 无阻塞」一角，代价是放宽到 <a href=\"../foundations/acid-cap-consistency\">最终一致</a> 并自行承担补偿与隔离对策的复杂度。选择 Saga，本质是判定「业务能容忍最终一致的中间窗口、且更看重各服务的独立可用性」。</p>\n<p>至于这串本地事务由谁来推动、补偿由谁来触发，有编排与协同两种风格，见 <a href=\"orchestration-choreography\">编排式与协同式 Saga</a>；补偿本身如何保证幂等、可交换、可重试，见 <a href=\"compensation-semantics\">补偿语义与幂等性</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Saga 把分布式事务拆成有序的本地事务序列 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>…</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_1 \\ldots T_n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，每步本地提交，失败时反向执行补偿 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>…</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{k-1} \\ldots C_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8917em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>补偿是业务层的逻辑撤销而非存储层的物理回滚，无法抹除已对外可见的副作用，故不可逆步骤应尽量靠后。</li>\n<li>Saga 整体只保 ACD、牺牲隔离性 I，由此引出脏读、丢失更新、模糊读三类异常。</li>\n<li>缺失的隔离性靠语义锁、状态字段、版本号、交换式更新等业务对策弥补，代价是复杂度转嫁给业务代码。</li>\n<li>Saga 与 <a href=\"../foundations/atomic-commit-2pc\">2PC</a> 的本质交换：用业务复杂度与 <a href=\"../foundations/acid-cap-consistency\">最终一致</a> 换无阻塞与高可用；推动方式见 <a href=\"orchestration-choreography\">编排与协同</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Saga 模式与补偿事务","id":"saga-模式与补偿事务"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：一串本地事务加补偿","id":"核心概念-一串本地事务加补偿"},{"level":2,"text":"补偿事务：逻辑撤销，而非物理回滚","id":"补偿事务-逻辑撤销-而非物理回滚"},{"level":2,"text":"牺牲隔离性：Saga 只保 ACD","id":"牺牲隔离性-saga-只保-acd"},{"level":2,"text":"弥补隔离性缺失的对策","id":"弥补隔离性缺失的对策"},{"level":2,"text":"Saga 与 2PC 的本质交换","id":"saga-与-2pc-的本质交换"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"原子提交与两阶段提交","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/distributed-transactions-saga/foundations/atomic-commit-2pc"},"next":{"title":"编排式与协同式 Saga","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/distributed-transactions-saga/saga/orchestration-choreography"}}